<item><title>Gunmen kill two in ambush on SPLM delegates in Mundri</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/gunmen-kill-two-in-ambush-on-splm-delegates-in-mundri-38a61c/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/gunmen-kill-two-in-ambush-on-splm-delegates-in-mundri-38a61c/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>Gunmen attacked a vehicle carrying SPLM delegates returning from party primaries in Mundri East County, killing a former journalist and a former teacher.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 07:28:35 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>South Sudan ministry demands 70% local staff on donor-funded projects</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-ministry-demands-70-local-staff-on-donor-funded-faa06a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-ministry-demands-70-local-staff-on-donor-funded-faa06a/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>The agriculture ministry wants UN agencies such as FAO and UNOPS to fill most project jobs with South Sudanese graduates, leaving 30 percent for foreigners.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 06:32:47 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Amnesty says South Sudan and UNMISS failed to prevent Abiemnom massacre</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/amnesty-says-south-sudan-and-unmiss-failed-to-prevent-306341/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/amnesty-says-south-sudan-and-unmiss-failed-to-prevent-306341/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>Amnesty International says more than 200 people were killed in Abiemnom in March despite warnings given at least two days before the attack.</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 10:33:54 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/amnesty-says-south-sudan-and-unmiss-failed-to-prevent-306341/share.jpg" length="43325" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/amnesty-says-south-sudan-and-unmiss-failed-to-prevent-306341/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Machar asks court to hear urgent complaint over his defence team</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/machar-asks-court-to-hear-urgent-complaint-over-his-defence-50df85/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/machar-asks-court-to-hear-urgent-complaint-over-his-defence-50df85/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>Former First Vice President Riek Machar raised the matter during the Special Court&apos;s 128th session, saying the defence needed the judges to act.</description><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:11:41 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
